// Compatibility shim -- NOT the config's content.
//
// This path was the Gadi site default (config/sites/gadi*.env -> NEXTFLOW_CONFIG)
// while slurm and local pointed at scripts/nextflow.*.all_tools.config. Keeping a
// second, hand-maintained copy of the same config is what let the Gadi one fall
// behind: it was missing the exit-255 retry, jobfs, the CheckM fix, and the
// DefenseFinder and organism-typer errorStrategy blocks, and it hardcoded one
// user's /scratch and /home paths. Runs failed on Gadi for weeks in ways that were
// already fixed in the scripts/ copy nobody was loading.
//
// The site envs now point at scripts/nextflow.gadi.all_tools.config directly. This
// file stays as an include so any deployment, doc, or local env still naming the
// old path gets the current config rather than a stale copy -- and so the two can
// never diverge again. Do not add settings here; edit the included file.
includeConfig '../scripts/nextflow.gadi.all_tools.config'
